  /* ---------- checklist ----------
     `auto 1fr` with `align-items: baseline`, so the italic numeral sits on the
     first BASELINE of its line's text rather than the top of the box — a marker
     that is 20px display italic next to 15px body would otherwise ride high on
     every row, and the misalignment only shows once a line wraps.

     `.candidate-list b` gets `margin-right: 6px` AND the markup keeps a literal
